translations.text:
My mouth will have the ardor of hell;
my mouth will be a hell of sweetness for you;
the angels of my mouth will reign in your heart;
my mouth will be crucified,
and your mouth will be the horizontal beam of the cross,
but what mouth will be the vertical beam of this cross?

O vertical mouth of my love,
the soldiers of my mouth will storm your depths;
the priests of my mouth will perfume your beauty with incense in its temple;
your body will shudder like a region in an earthquake;
then your eyes will fill
with all the love gathered
in every human gaze since humanity began.

My love,
my mouth will be an army against you,
an army full of folly,
changing as a magician
knows how to change his transformations;
for my mouth also turns toward your ear,
and above all my mouth will say love to you;
it murmurs the word from afar,
and a thousand angelic orders
stir within it, preparing a heavenly sweetness for you;
and my mouth is also the Order that makes you my slave
and gives me your mouth, Madeleine,
your mouth that I kiss, Madeleine.
